final paymentServiceProvider = Provider<PaymentService>((ref) {
  return PaymentService(ref.watch(dioProvider)); // your existing Dio provider
});

final paymentRepositoryProvider = Provider<PaymentRepository>((ref) {
  return RemotePaymentRepository(ref.watch(paymentServiceProvider));
});
```

If your project uses `riverpod_generator`, write these as `@riverpod` functions instead to match the existing code.

## Presentation

